(6829033, 1026387, 19825, '<td valign="top">A bold choice for your entry. Perhaps crazy, but bold. I bet this one is getting some comments. Technically, setting the subject aside for a moment, it is a pretty good photograph -- good focus, nice framing, strong leading line, etc. Makes me wonder if it is some kind of commentary on the voters or perhaps the challenge theme. You have gotten me to gaze into that toilet bowl for several moments. Hard to give a bad score to such an engaging photo.</td>', 'A bold choice for your entry. Perhaps crazy, but bold. I bet this one is getting some comments. Technically, setting the subject aside for a moment, it is a pretty good photograph -- good focus, nice framing, strong leading line, etc. Makes me wonder if it is some kind of commentary on the voters or perhaps the challenge theme. You have gotten me to gaze into that toilet bowl for several moments. Hard to give a bad score to such an engaging photo.', '2012-07-27 11:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
