(6830998, 1026635, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  The reflection in the glasses is great, although I wish I could see the dropped chips in the reflection rather than his arm.  The gritty processing/lighting works great on the guy but looks kind of washed out on the cards.  Catching a nice motion blur is hard and you did very well on it.  While minor, the wrinkles on the table kind of detract from an otherwise very well done image.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  The reflection in the glasses is great, although I wish I could see the dropped chips in the reflection rather than his arm.  The gritty processing/lighting works great on the guy but looks kind of washed out on the cards.  Catching a nice motion blur is hard and you did very well on it.  While minor, the wrinkles on the table kind of detract from an otherwise very well done image.', '2012-07-30 20:15:34.000000', NULL, 0),
