(6831126, 1026635, 129807, '<td valign="top">In addition to Bob''s comments, with which I agree wholeheartedly, I would add that the background doesn''t work for me. It looks very smooth with a lovely graduation, which is what I think doesn''t mesh with the remainder of the image - it looks unreal, pasted almost. Definite positive points are the reflection and the motion blur.</td>', 'In addition to Bob''s comments, with which I agree wholeheartedly, I would add that the background doesn''t work for me. It looks very smooth with a lovely graduation, which is what I think doesn''t mesh with the remainder of the image - it looks unreal, pasted almost. Definite positive points are the reflection and the motion blur.', '2012-07-31 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6831255, 1026620, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by charliebaker:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for the tribute Alexkc to my brown ribbon winner from July 11, 2008 <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=698076" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/889/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_698076.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/889/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_698076.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/889/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_698076.jpg"/></a>, a photo which scored 2.8289. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=57229" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">raish</a> offered his own tribute to "Portrait of the Sky" with his <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=763201" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/990/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_763201.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/990/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_763201.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/990/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_763201.jpg"/></a>, for the "Brown Ribbon Deja Vu" challenge back in Feb ''09. Love the stars! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks to you Charlie, glad you liked it!</td>', 'Originally posted by charliebaker: Thanks for the tribute Alexkc to my brown ribbon winner from July 11, 2008 , a photo which scored 2.8289.  raish offered his own tribute to "Portrait of the Sky" with his , for the "Brown Ribbon Deja Vu" challenge back in Feb ''09. Love the stars!   Thanks to you Charlie, glad you liked it!', '2012-07-31 05:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6831359, 1026635, 67152, '<td valign="top">That is quite an improvement on the original that you based yours on.  <br/> <br/>The pose and expression really make the shot - lots of attitude.  The reflection on the glasses provides that level of detail that takes it to the next level.  <br/> <br/>As others have stated, the background doesn''t work for me and gives this too much of a staged look and seems ''processed'' rather than real.</td>', 'That is quite an improvement on the original that you based yours on.   The pose and expression really make the shot - lots of attitude.  The reflection on the glasses provides that level of detail that takes it to the next level.   As others have stated, the background doesn''t work for me and gives this too much of a staged look and seems ''processed'' rather than real.', '2012-07-31 10:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
